1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,493
A New Farming Way.
新的耕作方式。

2
00:00:03,493 --> 00:00:33,453
Tuan was a farmer in Vietnam. For decades, he had been struggling to rid his family of hunger. However, it always confused him how to expand the output of his crops.
团是一名越南农民。几十年来，他一直努力让家人摆脱饥饿。然而，如何提高农作物产量，始终让他困惑。

3
00:00:33,453 --> 00:01:05,213
This disturbing problem led to his regretting being a farmer. He would rather have chosen another job. One day, when skimming through a newspaper, Tuan read a comment on Yuan Longping.
这个令人烦恼的问题使他后悔当了农民。他宁愿当初选择了别的工作。一天，浏览报纸时，团读到了一篇有关袁隆平的评论。

4
00:01:05,213 --> 00:01:47,273
He underlined Yuan’s nationality and occupation, and then focused on his discovery and the statistics of his research. He found the knowledge Yuan circulated very practical. Therefore, he made a summary and began to build up a new farming method.
他在袁隆平的国籍和职业下面画了线，然后重点关注他的发现及研究数据。他觉得袁隆平传播的知识非常实用。因此，他作了总结，开始逐步建立新的耕作方法。

5
00:01:47,273 --> 00:02:28,467
He planted super grain of rich nutrition and equipped himself to keep his crops’ roots free from bacteria and pests. He also enriched minerals in the soil while reducing chemical fertilizers. Though it cost him more time and freedom, he was full of hope.
他种植了营养丰富的超级谷物，并为自己做好准备、配备所需条件，让作物的根部免受细菌和害虫侵扰。他还增加土壤中的矿物质，同时减少化肥使用。虽然这花费了他更多时间，也占用了自由时间，他依然满怀希望。

6
00:02:28,467 --> 00:02:59,727
The next year, Tuan was sunburnt but satisfied with his production very much. Thanks to Yuan Longping, he not only won the battle against hunger, but he could also export his crops abroad.
第二年，团虽然晒黑了，却对产量十分满意。多亏了袁隆平，他不仅战胜了饥饿，还能把农作物出口到国外。
